WEBVTT

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:11.630
Oh.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.530
You got hungry and fell while looking for food, didn't you?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.620
I get it, I get it!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.120
I'll return you to your nest right away!

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.090
Ah!

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.430
What a troublesome child!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.800
Your mother must have a hard time.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.040
W-What?

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.900
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.900
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.900
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:50.620
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:50.620
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:50.620
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:06.620
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:06.620
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:06.620
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:13.140
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:13.140
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:13.140
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:18.810
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:18.810
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:18.810
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:25.440
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:25.440
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:25.440
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:31.610
kotae wo shiritai

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:31.610
答えを知りたい

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:31.610
I want to know the answer

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:38.500
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:38.500
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:38.500
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:44.750
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:44.750
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:44.750
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:50.930
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:50.930
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:50.930
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:01:51.130 --> 00:02:01.030
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:01:51.130 --> 00:02:01.030
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:01:51.130 --> 00:02:01.030
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.560
That's right, I was saved.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.300
It's heavy. It's really heavy.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.700
Nanael! Who is that?

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:51.740
Nanael, wake up!

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:54.590
No! You can't touch me in a place like that!

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.840
I'm a well-mannered girl, you need to stop.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.260
Just what kind of dream are you having?

00:02:59.260 --> 00:02:59.910
Ah!

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.120
Leina!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.800
Who is that girl?

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.290
Eh?

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.000
Ah! That is!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.580
The Maid of Temptation, Airi!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:14.040
If she's running rampant around the Elf Forest, could a battle with Combat Instructor Alleyne be on the horizon?

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.080
Elf Forest?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.510
I have to hurry and get going!

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.970
Combat Instructor Alleyne?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.340
Maid of Temptation, Airi?

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.400
How cruel!

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:38.750
Are you the one who did this?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.570
What are you going to do if I did?

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.110
Instructor said that recently, the witch of the swampland's subordinates

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.870
have been trying to turn the forests into swamps!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.710
Oh? To think that she could dodge my attack...

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.960
It's you, isn't it?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.300
The beautiful Elf Forest warrior.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.300
Leave this place at once! Otherwise, I won't forgive you!

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.310
Are you attempting to harm me? You've got some guts.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:15.160
Oh, how lucky! Nanael is so very lucky!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:19.930
All of these situations have looked so promising, but Nanael hasn't even recorded one Queen's Blade fight.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.530
If I returned to heaven like this, just what would the head angel say?

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.030
Now that I've got this fight, there won't be any more problems!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.370
It must be because I've been a good angel!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:34.150
Well then, to all participants of Queen's Blade, let us be guided by the battle that takes place here!

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.550
Let the gates of trial open!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.470
This warrior's name is the Maid of Tempation, Airi!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.330
Opposing her is Combat Instructor Alleyne!

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.390
Huh? That's not her.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.430
Your name is?

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.870
Nowa! Watchman of the forest, Nowa!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.730
I will not allow you to cause any more harm!

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:55.020
Participants, commence Queen's Blade!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:04.240
No way. Isn't that Nowa?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.180
You're right.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.600
What is she doing out there?

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.530
That's Queen's Blade, isn't it?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.140
I hope she doesn't cause problems for the forest.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.070
It will take more than that to hurt me!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.710
Thank you, Ru!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.430
That's not a regular monkey, is it?

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.340
That's it! Both of you, do your best!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:28.140
That Maid's scythe attacks are powerful!

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.200
Coming to this remote forest wasn't a waste, after all.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.190
What delicious looking life energy...

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.980
<i>I'll be done in at this rate.</i>

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.230
Please continue trying your best.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:46.830
A bit of fear and uncertainty in your life energy will make it even more delicious to eat.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.620
You will not escape.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.410
Nowa will protect this forest!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:05:59.710
You're too naive!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.300
She's fast! That Elf's movements changed!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.430
You've got some nice moves here in the forest, don't you?

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:15.640
However, you won't be able to defeat me at that level.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.160
G-Ghosts!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.320
You're just like a wild animal, aren't you?

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.990
You're not even wearing underwear.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.880
Eh? She's not wearing any panties?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.910
Elf girls are the worse, aren't they?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.000
Ah!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.340
I've caught you.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:44.440
Despair is most certainly the best sauce...

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.380
I'm losing my strength...

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.470
Please show me the fruitfulness of your suffering.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:54.600
Let fear and dismay awaken in your heart, and refresh me with your life energy.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.670
That Maid is a monster!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:00.700
We have to help her!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.260
If we did something like that{fscx200}-

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:02.730
Ah!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.560
That's against the rules of Queen's Blade!

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:06.900
You big-breasted idiot!

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.370
What overflowing energy!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.790
To think that your body was full of so much energy...

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.170
You can't interfere, Leina!

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.480
Leina?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.680
I see. You're the one who defeated Melona.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:31.470
Something like that happened, but...

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:38.100
Your body holds so much fighting spirit, indecency, and beauty...

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.810
It looks like I'll be harvesting the best life energy from you.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.220
Prepare yourself, Leina-sama!

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.710
Leina... It's been a while.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.830
One of these days, you really will die.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:58.050
Ah! It looks like that person managed to survive!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.160
It seems that way.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:03.260
But no matter how you look at it, we're in a much worse situation...

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:04.590
I suppose you're right.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:07.800
Oh, that young lady was in a place like that?

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.470
It's not too far, but that troublesome Instructor is around there, isn't she?

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:16.260
Wouldn't it be better just to stay here and drink?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.390
Huh?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:21.230
Ah! It's been disqualified again!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:31.280
Well then, I'll be taking my reward!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.120
What wonderful life energy that was!

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:48.710
Either stand down, or I will slash your throat. Now, decide!

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:51.840
Eh?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:03.510
I will definitely take your life energy next time!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:10.340
Just a second! Leina!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.820
Leina! Leina!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:22.370
I'm Nowa! I'm one of the watchmen of this forest!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.380
And this is Ru. He's Nowa's important friend!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.460
Watchman of the forest?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.470
That's right! We stop trespassers from entering this place.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.840
Ah! Nowa shouldn't have let a human enter the forest!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.310
I-I'm sorry! I didn't know!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:43.110
That's okay. Leina saved Nowa, after all.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:47.770
The combat instructor said this: "If you give water in kindness, you will be repaid with a fountain of gratitude."

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:49.300
Combat Intructor?

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:53.330
The Elf tribe once suffered due to persecution by humans.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.130
Instructor!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:58.930
After dealing with that calamity, we had to purify ourselves of their presence.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.750
Humans are not allowed to step foot into this forest.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.970
But my disciple has allowed a human to escape into this forest.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:07.600
Nowa, zero points.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:08.310
Ah!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.090
Nowa...

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:14.640
However, we will repay kindness that has been received.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.630
Even if it was from a human.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:17.720
Ah!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:22.320
I am Alleyne. I am the Combat Instructor of this forest.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:26.190
You are Combat Instructor Alleyne?

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.340
Well? What do you think of the Elf forest's secret medicine?

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.170
Amazing!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.150
It hurts a little, but the wound has already started to heal.

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:39.930
I acquired this medicine from the Elder for your sake.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.760
All to save a human.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.700
You helped Nowa out!

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:45.600
Don't misunderstand!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.600
I have to take responsiblity for my disciple's mistakes.

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:51.010
More importantly, what was with that fight?

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.040
Your ability to read your opponent's movements is still lacking!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.680
Nowa, thirty-five points.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.840
I'm sorry...

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:59.160
You looked after my disciple.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:03.640
I will negotiate with the Elder so that you may be allowed to rest here until your wound has healed.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.000
You have my thanks.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.380
I would like to express my gratitude to the Elder personally.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:08.430
Understood.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.440
Over here, Leina!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.070
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:20.150
<i>Strangely, I feel more energetic just by looking at her smiling face.</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:20.740
<i>But...</i>

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.880
<i>As I thought, she's not wearing any panties, is she?</i>

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:25.900
<i>But why?</i>

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.460
<i>Could it be that all elves...</i>

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.020
<i>Leaves!?</i>

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.910
Is something the matter?

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.420
Ah, no... nothing at all.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.510
<i>By the way, where's Nanael?</i>

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:43.720
As if Nanael is going to leave without clearing her name!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:11:59.820
Thank you very much!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:01.250
<i>Thank goodness!</i>

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.030
<i>He seemed hard to please, but I think that these are good people.</i>

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.040
It's a human! A human!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.930
Nowa brought her here.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.140
Could it be that she's plotting something?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:12.290
What suspicious behavior.

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:13.300
How scary!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.150
<i>This nonsense is giving me a bad feeling...</i>

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.710
Just what is the meaning of this?

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.350
Even if the Elder has permitted this, we will not allow it!

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.510
It's all your fault for inviting her, Nowa!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.390
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.810
This is all Nowa's fault, so please help Leina!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:29.520
Nowa!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.820
Ah! I get it now...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.560
I might be able to use this!

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:46.090
I'm okay, Ru.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.890
Nowa will be just fine.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.410
Is it okay if I come up, Nowa?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.520
Ah, Leina!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.740
Everyone is really worried.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:56.750
Worried?

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:01.130
Half of the blood flowing through Nowa's body is human.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:05.750
That's why everyone thinks that something horrible will happen because of Nowa one day.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.580
That's just strange!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.730
You're trying your best. There's no way something like that could happen!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:11.680
That's true...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.040
The one who is actually protecting the forest is you, isn't it{fscx200}-

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.110
Nowa is very grateful, you know.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:22.590
It made Nowa very happy when she was entrusted with the important task of guarding this forest.

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:25.320
Because Nowa was able to protect everyone that was important to her...

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.030
Nowa...

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:31.330
Also, no matter what anyone says, Nowa is Nowa, right?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.000
<i>She must be so lonely...</i>

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.320
<i>She looks just like Onee-sama from back then...</i>

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.410
Have you heard about Claudette-sama?

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:57.210
Yes, the Count has confined her to the castle.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.510
<i>Finally, the time has come!</i>

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.060
<i>Wait for me, Onee-chan!</i>

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:09.750
<i>No matter where you are, I will search for you!</i>

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.340
Troops, move out!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.470
No matter what anyone says, huh?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.850
<i>Both Nowa and my sister have been fighting for something...</i>

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.520
<i>Just what should I do?</i>

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.820
Is the troubled young virgin finally becoming an adult?

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:43.690
Nanael?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:48.200
It seems that something interesting is happening in the village. Would you like to come and see?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:48.780
Eh?

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:57.210
We called out to the spirit of the forest...

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:01.210
And it has implied that eventually, two powers will clash and devastation shall occur.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:05.400
And on that day, our city will certainly be caught up in it.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.000
As thought, it cannot be avoided.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.150
Isn't that girl responsible for all of this?

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.430
That girl that has human blood flowing through her.

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:18.690
Well then, why don't we make her participate in that foolish tournament?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.550
Whether she wins or loses, it will not affect us.

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.380
It is a superb idea.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.300
Are there any objections?

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.530
None.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.590
Then, the entire assembly is in agreement.

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:34.010
Alleyne, please notify Nowa that she will be setting out in the morning.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.330
Understood.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.250
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:41.380
That group is forcing Nowa to leave the village.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.000
Eh?

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.130
It's cruel, isn't it?

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.080
You can't forgive them for it, can you?

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:45.900
I know!

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.950
Why don't you go over there and beat them all up?

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.760
Especially that Alleyne...

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.640
It looks like she's motivated now!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.680
Why didn't you stop them?

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.040
Everything is for the sake of this forest.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.060
Nowa has always followed under you!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.150
Can you really just throw her out like that?

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:07.030
It might be fate.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:11.310
This day was destined to come. All that was foretold is now taking shape.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:12.530
That's just sophistry!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:15.610
Nowa has already prepared herself for this, knowing it would happen one day.

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:16.510
That's not...

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.700
Nowa will have to decide for herself.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.610
By participating in Queen's Blade, she will fulfill the wishes of everyone in the forest.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:25.040
That doesn't make things any better!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.950
If you stop her, even that girl...

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.310
Me? Stop her?

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.800
What would a human like you understand?

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.470
<i>Is it impossible for me to go in her place?</i>

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.310
<i>Please understand this, Alleyne.</i>

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.010
<i>These are times of turmoil.</i>

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:44.260
<i>We need your strength to protect this forest and those who reside in it.</i>

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:49.890
<i>For you to enter a tournament created by those repulsive humans is something that we will never allow.</i>

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:54.620
The laws of the forest will not change, even if someone objects.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.410
Alright! My plan succeeded!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.540
That's it! Go!

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.030
You're wrong! You're wrong!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.600
You're definitely wrong!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.670
You must be regretting it.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:04.630
Otherwise, that's too sad for Nowa!

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:07.380
Ru?

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:14.470
Hold on! What about the fight? What about Queen's Blade?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.370
Take care, everyone.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.160
Nowa will surely return one day.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.180
Leina?

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:46.860
Is that all you've got? Even though I just healed from my wounds?

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:47.750
Why?

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:51.590
This wasn't part of my plan, but a duel is a duel, right?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.470
Well then, it's time for the long awaited Queen's Blade...

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.340
J-Just kidding!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:01.390
<i>Show it to me, my disciple...</i>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.640
<i>Show me your determination.</i>

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:10.190
<i>Rejected by elves and humans alike, you strayed into the forest.</i>

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.080
<i>I've always expected great things from you.</i>

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.030
<i>No matter where you go, you will become strong.</i>

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:21.990
<i>But Nowa...</i>

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.250
<i>Is this really what you desire?</i>

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.370
To leave this forest?

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.550
I don't understand you.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:34.510
If you participate in Queen's Blade, you may not be able to return here.

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:38.180
Also, no one even wishes for you to become Queen!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.450
Why?

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:40.700
Nowa knew.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.230
Everyone in the forest hated Nowa.

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:45.400
Everyone wanted Nowa to leave this forest!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.770
Even so, why were you happy?

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:50.770
T-That is...

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.230
Nowa, answer me!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:19:00.000
Nowa loves everyone very much... the animals... and Instructor, too...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.620
The truth is, Nowa doesn't want to leave...

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.400
But Nowa's okay with it!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.400
I'm willing to do it for everyone!

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:11.540
This was the first real home Nowa ever had, after all!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.850
<i>How unfair... After hearing something like that, I...</i>

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.710
Instructor said this:

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:29.350
"If you are never dishonest with yourself, you can lead yourself to a shining future."

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:32.940
Nowa...

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:39.120
I appreciate your kindness.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.490
I will use these provisions with great care.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:45.190
To the one who desires freedom, I wish you a safe journey.

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.580
Instructor!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.230
Do not cry, my disciple.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:51.590
You will be our representative.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:52.950
Hold your head up high.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.710
You take care too, Instructor!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.100
Nowa will... Nowa will...!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.920
Further talk is not necessary for your journey.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:19:59.510
Hurry up and go.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:09.220
Nowa will never forget the time she spent with Instructor.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.020
Thank you, Instructor!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:11.850
Nowa...

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:21.100
Come home safely.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:23.660
Okay!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:33.580
Geez! After all that, I still wasn't able to broadcast the competition!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.870
I know! You two should hurry up and fight!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.880
I don't want to, Nowa is too strong!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.360
Then next time that we fight will be in Queen's Blade, right?

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:42.800
Well, I wonder...

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.610
However, I promise to fight you someday.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.020
Let's become stronger, the two of us.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:48.960
Yeah!

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:50.800
Well then, I'm going!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:51.920
Um...

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.590
You know, I...

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:57.570
I feel like I learned something very important from you.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:59.220
Eh? From Nowa?

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:02.820
Yes. Everyone has their own way of doing things.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.740
That's what I've learned from watching you.

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:07.790
Ah, that's right...

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:10.310
Can I ask you one last thing?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.660
It's been bothering me this whole time, but...

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:15.180
Um... That is...

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.050
<i>Like I thought, she's not wearing any!</i>

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.800
<i>Why isn't she wearing any?</i>

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:33.810
Feelings!

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:34.570
Feelings! Feelings! Feelings!

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:35.790
To hell with all these feelings!

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:40.280
It's all cliché and boring! I can't take this anymore!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
I can't express my overflowing feelings well

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
kizutsuita sono bun dake

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
傷ついたその分だけ

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
Hurting will, to an extent,

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
tsuyoku narerundato kigatsuite

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
強くなれるんだと気がついて

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
Make you realize how much stronger you can become

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
takaku tooku ton demiseru

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
高く遠く飛んでみせる

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
You can fly high and far away

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
hisoka ni jibun to chikatta

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
密かに自分と誓った

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
Surely and secretly for yourself

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
kiseki wa itsumo dareka no kimagure

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
奇跡はいつも誰かの気まぐれ

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
Miracles are always fickle for everyone

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
onnaji sora no shitani aru nara

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
おんなじ空の下にあるなら

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
If we are under the same sky

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
keshite akirametari shinai

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
けして諦めたりしない

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
We will never give up

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
wasurenai kara ano hi no koto

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
忘れないからあの日のこと

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
I won't forget about that day

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
No matter how much time passes by

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afuretekuru

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
Confusing feelings overflow in my heart

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:16.980
It's finally time to meet with the other angels.

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:22.510
I understand. I get it, already. There's always some impending danger I need to correct, right?

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:25.340
Reporting, communicating, advising... There are so many things I don't want to do!

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:29.200
Liveliness, willingness, courageousness, and all sorts of other 'ness', it all bothers me!

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:33.870
I know all that already! This is bad, this is really bad, this is all bad!

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:35.850
Next time is going to be my greatest pinch!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.810
Next time: Nanael's impending crisis!

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:38.390
Not really!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.380
Next time: Kourin ~ Angel of Glory!

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:43.400
No matter what, I won't let this be the end of me!
